From b30d759d375e69164b0da842250cb69c785ece5c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yzddmr6 <46088090+yzddmr6@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 10:02:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] soc: qcom: llcc-qcom: Reserve ISLAND1 ways on SM8750

SM8750 assigns the ISLAND1 slice's 31 ways to bonus_ways instead of
res_ways. Restore the reserved mask used by the original SM8750 support
posting before its conversion to designated initializers. The reservation
is needed when LPASS core votes are released during system suspend.

Apply this correction before allowing the LPASS macro codecs to release
their prepare votes, since the unreserved slice can cause a PS_HOLD reset
when entering low-power states.

Fixes: 2c04e58e30ce ("soc: qcom: llcc-qcom: Add support for SM8750")
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20250113-sm8750_llcc_master-v1-3-5389b92e2d7a@quicinc.com

Assisted-by: LLM
Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/soc/qcom/llcc-qcom.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/soc/qcom/llcc-qcom.c b/drivers/soc/qcom/llcc-qcom.c
index 8948b5fd4..9c670bf6e 100644
--- a/drivers/soc/qcom/llcc-qcom.c
+++ b/drivers/soc/qcom/llcc-qcom.c
@@ -3747,7 +3747,7 @@ static const struct llcc_slice_config sm8750_data[] = {
 		.max_cap = 7936,
 		.priority = 7,
 		.fixed_size = true,
-		.bonus_ways = 0x7fffffff,
+		.res_ways = 0x7fffffff,
 	}, {
 		.usecase_id = LLCC_DISP_WB,
 		.slice_id = 23,
-- 
